 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased — Phase 3 cumulative recording and song-reactive showcase
+- Native `dancerudiments.recording` v1 import, float64 binary cache and non-looping source-clock sampling.
+- Real-source song profile wizard with original-master SHA-256, StemLab corrected-map validation, explicit source alignment and separately stored user media.
+- Song-reactive procedural trees/grass, atmosphere, palette shifting, procedural geometry warp and typed motion bindings.
+- Seek-safe bounded 4 MiB GPU windowed sampling with adjacent-row overlap, preserving exact CPU source pip and float64 original values.
+- Local `.json`/`.json.gz` StemLab/DanceRudiments asset provenance receipts and CI checks without redistributing copyrighted audio.
+- Source changes provided without claiming Unity 6 GPU/hardware acceptance or a published Phase 3 release.
+
+
 ## Unreleased — Phase 3B sample groundwork
 - Add optional native-motion-driven procedural landscape demo with generated tree, batched grass, terrain, stars and warp tower meshes.
 - Expose four typed, source-clock-mapped recording channels as shader globals with explicit synthetic provenance.
